Thought: This configuration improved to 0.735033. The skip_connect on edge 3<-0 helped. Let me try more variations around this. The optimal in NAS-Bench-201 for CIFAR-10 is often |nor_conv_3x3~0|+|nor_conv_3x3~0|nor_conv_3x3~1|+|skip_connect~0|nor_conv_3x3~1|nor_conv_3x3~2| which is what I just tried. 

